{title: Above all else}

{comment: Chorus}
For above all else I must be saved
For above all else I must be saved
For whatever You have to do to me Don’t let me be lost for eternity
For above all else I must be saved

{comment: Verse 1}
More than security, more than success
If I should have to choose on thing, I’d take Jesus o’er the rest
And if I could attain the goal to gain this world and all it holds
Then if I should lose my should, then I have lost it all

{comment: Verse 2}
Even though the souls of men that I love seem oh so dear
More than others I must make my own salvation sure
For if I to others show the way and then I become just a castaway
This price I can’t afford to pay my soul is worth much more
